  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/taint1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review on dev 100b6fbb6e (WI-losod merged as a0a706f8dd): probe of void f(int n){ int i; for (i = 0; i < n; i++) { use(i); } } gives 'int i;' def=[] use=[], the for initializer defines i, and unaccounted_names = ['i']. c_def_use.py:150 rule unchanged (docs-only commits since). Premise unchanged. MECHANISM: a bare C declarator is neither a def nor a use yet mentions a tracked name. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-nohuv."  # 3384
